#. inDungeon
msgctxt "589164"
msgid "…it doesn't…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "589184"
msgid "Jinako? Let's search this area, Master."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "589224"
msgid "I just heard her. She can't be far."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "589264"
msgid "Hmm? Did you hear something just now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590224"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591016"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591216"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591344"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591744"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591852"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592640"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593332"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593964"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594224"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594332"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594608"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594740"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595692"
msgid "What's with this half-ass map?\nA Hyperbolic Time Chamber? She came up with\nsomething NEW to harass us with, hasn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595948"
msgid "These \"gamers\" really love their grinding,\ndon't they!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596524"
msgid "It's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Servant, #C236196003Karna#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596880"
msgid "……………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597320"
msgid "Gulp…\nThis is our chance, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "597720"
msgid "Where is Jinako?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597936"
msgid "My Darling isn't going to fall for that\nabandoned-puppy look!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598008"
msgid "…you won't, right?\nANYWAY, where's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599420"
msgid "There's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599616"
msgid "……………\nOh, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599664"
msgid "Just leave me alone.\nThere's no co-op mode in ghosting.\nJust a versus mode."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599960"
msgid "How strange.\nEven the sunniest person looks\ndepressed in that position."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600032"
msgid "Not as depressed as you get when you miss\na sale on your Commissary pastries,\nthough, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600140"
msgid "Feeling morose, are we～?\nFeeling damp and cold, are we～?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601144"
msgid "No, there's a subtle difference.\nSince the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is finite,\nthe Labyrinth must also be finite―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601776"
msgid "Basically, this match between us and #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nwill likely become one of attrition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602760"
msgid "In comparison, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is alone.\nShe can't run away forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602972"
msgid "At any rate, let's find #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603020"
msgid "We can't let her be alone like this…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603488"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF…………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603656"
msgid "Don't stop moving, Praetor.\nYou won't catch anything with this\neffort of tracking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605056"
msgid "Thank god my delinquent, rebellious phase\nwas in the digital era, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605328"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605524"
msgid "However―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605644"
msgid "……………hrmm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606112"
msgid "If this… blatant thing is a trap,\nthen she may just be throwing in the towel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607692"
msgid "What is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607704"
msgid "What is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF doing!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608696"
msgid "Could this be―――an Item Folder?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "608740"
msgid "Search it."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "608752"
msgid "Leave it alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608816"
msgid "―――Suddenly!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608832"
msgid "A trap…!?\nHm? Praetor, where have you gone?\nAhhh! My Praetor vanished again!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609016"
msgid "A glittering, shiny house!\nI-I apologize for calling you a hunk of trash!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609508"
msgid "\nI wished for a redo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610260"
msgid "My family wasn't super rich,\nand I wasn't a 200 IQ genius nor beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610352"
msgid "But I was pretty happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610376"
msgid "A fairly strict household,\na fairly princess-like upbringing as an only daughter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610512"
msgid "Since we were in the upper middle class,\nI received a handsome inheritance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610688"
msgid "\"#C236196003Jinako#CDEF    obtained   inheritance!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610840"
msgid "I guess my love for accumulating little things\nlittle by little meant that I was an otaku at heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611176"
msgid "My internet friends were jealous\nand constantly fawned over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611364"
msgid "I celebrated the continuing of this lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611536"
msgid "Papa gave me the name \"#C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\"\nHe was ordinary and a bit chubby;\nsometimes so mediocre that it ticked me off―\nBut I loved him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611692"
msgid "Rather than love mama, I admired her.\nMama was so kind and pretty that she was\nway out of papa's league."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611820"
msgid "My family wasn't super rich,\nand I wasn't a 200 IQ genius nor beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612008"
msgid "And yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612252"
msgid "I didn't go on to high school.\nSince nobody told me to go,\nI dragged myself into seclusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612344"
msgid "I mean, I had money for life.\nNo one could bother me.\nWho could blame me if I used entertainment as an escape?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612748"
msgid "I would bluff by signing off with my usual line.\nOn the internet, #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF was a revered Game Champ."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613040"
msgid "Ahh, there I go again.\nI go full snail-mode when this happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613172"
msgid "I'm a winner. I'm a winner. I'm a winner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613636"
msgid "On PJ, Asia's Game Champ (lol) said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613732"
msgid "Despite that post, I took it to be \"the real deal.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613944"
msgid "That's why I joined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614032"
msgid "\n…I wished for a redo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614396"
msgid "I had given up on my life,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614500"
msgid "But no one told me anything about THIS.\nI had completely forgotten about how much of a coward I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615684"
msgid "D-did you just pop out of that sweet,\nmini-mini home!?\nCould this be a cursed abode…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616904"
msgid "What is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "616980"
msgid "A friend."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "617012"
msgid "My BFF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617024"
msgid "A friend? Really, a friend?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617056"
msgid "Man, wake up.\nOnly way that's remotely possible is if\nyou're into this kind of body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617152"
msgid "We're totes BFFs～ Like OMG 薗\nWhat kind of normie trash are you spouting?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617232"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's in a piiiinch. Won't leave room.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF says… pizza pigs… are no go. RIP."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617368"
msgid "That ain't it.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is a dead end to you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617548"
msgid "Alright.\nLet's assume you are my \"friend.\"\nThen what exactly is a \"friend\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618460"
msgid "…………#C236196003Jinako#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618788"
msgid "Stop caring about me, please!\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's got friends, too…\nSomewhere in this world…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619128"
msgid "Won't this inflict #C236196003Jinako#CDEF with an irreversible wound?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619888"
msgid "Why isn't it getting through that girl's head?\nWe're merely trying to escape the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, not\nearnestly meddle with the affairs of others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620064"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620080"
msgid "――――What is it?\nYou seek my advice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620196"
msgid "This woman isn't wishing for friends or whatnot.\nShe has yet to attain such a level."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620392"
msgid "What even an infant should be able to obtain\nhas been taken from her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620476"
msgid "…#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620808"
msgid "Come ON, do you even get how condescending\nthat sounds? You don't, do you!?\nThat's because YOU'RE actually strong!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "620932"
msgid "You're still not alone, Jinako."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621036"
msgid "Stop it, for real…\nI want to be here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621088"
msgid "It hurts, anyhow.\nIt's hopeless for me…\nI don't feel, anything, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621164"
msgid "So, ahhh…\nIt hurts… it hurts, it really hurts…\nWhy does it…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621232"
msgid "I'm lonely…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621440"
msgid "Her #C000246204SG#CDEF is \"#C000246204Loneliness#CDEF,\" huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621892"
msgid "Good job for now, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nYou're one step closer to the outside."
msgstr ""

