msgctxt "656024"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656128"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656264"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656308"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656448"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656568"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656668"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656860"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656924"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657004"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657120"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657248"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657292"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657420"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657548"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657656"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657744"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657836"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657984"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658068"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658200"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658300"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658460"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658588"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658680"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658812"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658912"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659120"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659244"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659376"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659468"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659592"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659672"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659776"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659864"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "659984"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "660068"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "660148"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "660216"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "660256"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "660288"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "660320"
msgid "Return to the old school?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660348"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is somewhere on this floor.\nAlthough, I don't know where, exactly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660440"
msgid "You'll have to try exploring every nook\nand cranny. I won't move from this spot.\nI won't hinder you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660544"
msgid "\"Where is the key\"?\n…sorry. I'm inept when it comes to\nlittle details like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660628"
msgid "If this Labyrinth is a reflection of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's\nmind, then the key to unlocking it logically\nmust also be within here… so I would guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660780"
msgid "Use that key and the door will open. This will\nbe a rough way to settle things, but sometimes\ndrastic measures are needed, I suppose…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660916"
msgid "I'm sure she noticed us, but won't even cast a glance.\nIt's really tough to talk to her like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661016"
msgid "I still have to.\nI took a single step forward,\nwhen #C236196003Jinako#CDEF started to mutter:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661112"
msgid "…what is she trying to accomplish?\nShe doesn't look like she's having any fun…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661196"
msgid "If you insist on condemning yourself,\nthen you need bigger #ROFS0002#RUBS  actions#RUBEgestures#REND,\nor you won't get through to your audience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661344"
msgid "If you've got the time to be all down, drawing\n\"Mickley Mouse\" on the floor with your tears,\nthen act like a dang #RUBS area boss#RUBE#C000246204Sentinel#CDEF#REND and get to WORK."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661528"
msgid "Well, well. This putrid mass has outdone itself.\nTHAT is mankind's oldest posture\nfor gaining attention."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661636"
msgid "That position, to those who use it, is a demonic\nskill for attracting even unknown strangers to\ncome talk―――Though, it does little for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661780"
msgid "Shut it…\nUgh, so annoying. Just blabberin' away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661832"
msgid "And after I FINALLY #ROFS0002#RUBS   purged #RUBEseparated#REND from\nthat fussy mother-in-law of a Servant, #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661964"
msgid "Guess that means I can't get any peace\nand quiet in this spot, either.\nDoesn't really bother me. It is what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662080"
msgid "Ain't it just SO great to have an admirable\nServant, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!?\nDeath to survivalists."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662180"
msgid "She's gone…\nI didn't even get a chance to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662232"
msgid "Seems like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nafter parting with her usual slang threat,\nteleported away somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662340"
msgid "…that explains it.\nThe layout of the eleventh floor is \nsparsely structured so she can do that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662440"
msgid "By layout, you mean the stuff in here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662484"
msgid "Erm, in order to teleport without limit,\nshe put as few obstacles as she could, you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662576"
msgid "The formula requires #RUBS      entrance#RUBEa divergence#REND and\na #ROFS0003#RUBS           promise of an exit#RUBEsingular point of convergence#REND. A Labyrinth\nwithout this premise will end in collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662784"
msgid "…oh. As immense as #C236196003BB#CDEF's power is, that's why\nshe couldn't just devise a way to end this from\nthe start; that's why she's been so oblique."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662940"
msgid "A solution we can't discover―――but #C236196003BB#CDEF also\ncan't obtain. She has no effective way, outside\nof constructing obstacles, to keep it secure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663096"
msgid "…honestly, I'm not really following…\nBut I get the feeling it's\nlike the repetition-draw rule in chess…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663204"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF? Sorry for this,\nbut please keep #C000246204searching for Jinako#CDEF.\nStay on her tail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663340"
msgid "Good.\nThese are rare and wise military staff officers.\nElites that conquerors of any age would envy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663444"
msgid "Moreover, with me as your blade, they serve as\nthe cane that supports you, Praetor. We can\nclear a Labyrinth like this in no time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663576"
msgid "Great… Thanks for the reassuring encouragement.\nThey're fast-talkers and they don't mince\nwords―but better to have them than not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663708"
msgid "After all, our greatest threat from this\nLabyrinth might just be boredom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663784"
msgid "There's no reason why we would lose.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is alone. But we're two people\nbecause there's two of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663904"
msgid "After all, \"1 plus 1 equals #RUBS   Love#RUBE鷙#REND\"!\nIsn't that right, Darling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663988"
msgid "There's no method more tedious than that,\nbut the plan itself is quite simple."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664068"
msgid "It seems this will become a question of\npatience, but it likely will not be in vain.\nYou have logistical support, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664196"
msgid "Sure, this seems like it'll be plain work,\nbut the resolution is simple.\nI have not only #C236196003#SVT#CDEF with me,\nbut #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664356"
msgid "…but… I wonder if that's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664404"
msgid "This landscape from her mind,\nalong with how #C236196003Jinako#CDEF was acting…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664488"
msgid "I get the feeling that we shouldn't just\ncatch her and call it a day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664560"
msgid "Again, yo?\nYou just don't know when to quit, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664628"
msgid "…go ahead, keep searching. It's pointless.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is an authority on re-playthroughs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664732"
msgid "Repetitive speedruns, infinite duping―\nthey get my dopamine pumping every round.\nSo actually, I welcome it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664844"
msgid "I was ready this time, but she got away\nagain like it was nothing.\nWhat am I supposed to do?\nThe previous Labyrinths had\ncorridors with dead-ends, but here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665004"
msgid "Only one option, I guess.\nRight under the realm of expectation.\nLet's go, before our feet get sore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665104"
msgid "…ugh. Not much choice, is there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665140"
msgid "I mean, compared to being the one chased,\nthere's NO STRESS in being the chaser.\n…take it from me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665240"
msgid "Struggling, isn't she?\nTime for you two mongrels to show\noff your willpower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665320"
msgid "Once again we ran into #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\ncurled up in a corner of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665408"
msgid "Looking at her from the side, I can't tell if\nshe's getting fed up with being chased around.\nAll I can see is that she looks more spaced out than ever…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665564"
msgid "Okay! Okay, okay, okay, okay―――\nJust let ME handle this.\nFirst, let's break her knees."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665656"
msgid "Oh, please. I don't mean it literally. I just\nwant to teach her about being moderate in all\nthings. Even despots care about aesthetics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665792"
msgid "―――What do we do?\nDid you come up with a plan, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665852"
msgid "Bind her neat～ Bind her neat～♪\nWith this chant, seal her feet～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665924"
msgid "Please ignore the similarity to tales like\n\"The Three Charms,\" with their whole\n\"use this magic to get away\"#ROFS-007#RUBSkind of thing#RUBE motif#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666080"
msgid "So, third time's the charm?\nWhat will you do?\nI can do this my own way, if you wish."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "666168"
msgid "Try something on my own."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "666196"
msgid "All she'll do is act stubborn, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666236"
msgid "All we can do is persevere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666264"
msgid "Besides, I know from my battles against\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF that it's impossible to extract\nan #C000246204SG#CDEF via brute force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666420"
msgid "…………I'm so sick of this.\nWhy do you hafta drag things out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666484"
msgid "These days, stern lectures and night patrol\nteachers are uhh-novel (i.e. pointless).\nIt suits that old school, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666604"
msgid "THIS is the quantum age, yo. What do you know,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF? You with your #SVT[old hag of a][anachronism of a][worn-out][unfathomably ancient]# \nServant, going out for walks by choice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666800"
msgid "I would be lying if I said I wasn't swelling with anger.\nYet, this #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is precisely a product\nof #C236196003BB#CDEF splitting up her personality.\nI can't go losing it over each\nand every one of her sarcastic comments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667040"
msgid "Don't pay me any more mind.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's got friends too, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667120"
msgid "………………\n…………friends?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667152"
msgid "………………heeerrre we go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667180"
msgid "……………*sigh*.\nNow she's gone and made a fool of\nherself for the THIRD time…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667264"
msgid "So she says she \"has friends\"?\nThere's no better final refuge to take."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667336"
msgid "This is… a model house, I guess?\nIt seems like it has some meaning behind it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667416"
msgid "Well isn't this cute?\nShall we look at the interio―the door\nwon't open. It's welded shut."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667508"
msgid "Isn't this just some objet d'art?\nThe door, windows, and walls are all one,\nsingle piece. It's just a paperweight then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667628"
msgid "Hmm, this is terrible. Could they have cut any\nmore corners? It's like, a hunk of trash. The\nwindows and door seem to be mere decoration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667768"
msgid "Heh. Only YOU would look at this and\nsee a model house, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667836"
msgid "Note the roof, not the walls!\nThis is unmistakably one of THOSE. My intuition\nnever fails when it comes to all THOSE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667956"
msgid "With #C236196003#SVT#CDEF speaking behind me,\nI search over the model house."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668036"
msgid "…I see.\nThe doors and windows really are decorations.\nInstead, this, the roof opens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668124"
msgid "I place my hands on the roof\nand try opening it like a treasure chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668196"
msgid "There's… smoke…!?\nDid we really fall for the oldest trap\nin the book? You okay, Master!? …Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668300"
msgid "No matter the design, a home is\nfilled with the husband's dreams. This is the\nnatural punishment for my ridicule."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668416"
msgid "But if little old #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF HAD the choice,\nI would love a house with a pool, Darrrrllling鷙\nDarling? Hello, Darling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668548"
msgid "Argh! How tactless, blinding us like that…!\nTHESE are the creatures I loathe the most!\nEven more than those summertime pests!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668676"
msgid "Know this, mongrel. Treasure chest-mimicking\nknaves have been known since ancient times as\ndeception-devourers… hm? Where did you go?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668812"
msgid "To redo my life.\nUp until I was fifteen years old,\nI thought that way as if it were natural,\nand I expected it to happen in the future\nas if it were natural."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668972"
msgid "\"If only I could get that chance.\"\nI joined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nhalf for fun, half for my wish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669084"
msgid "Without knowing that it was a serious slaughter-fest;\na deathmatch where only one person can be left standing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669196"
msgid "\n\nNo, I had known the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's rules from the rumors.\nBut not taking things seriously is a bad habit of mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669332"
msgid "Countless times so far,\nI had spent my days with a \"whatever\" attitude―\nSo this was the greatest punishment I could have ever deserved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669472"
msgid "\nIt was papa who named me \"#C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\"\nMama was Japanese, and he loved her just the way she was.\nOf course, he also loved Japanese culture."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669628"
msgid "\"I'd like her name to sound like a little Japanese girl.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669688"
msgid "Apparently over something like that,\nhe picked the sound of \"#C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669776"
msgid "One day, papa and mama passed away in an unfortunate accident."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669840"
msgid "Although, one could also view it as enough\nmoney for a single girl to keep food on\nthe table for the rest of her life, if she lives modestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669984"
msgid "That's when the curtains opened\non my new life as a winner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670044"
msgid "Obviously I didn't move up to high school.\nThere was no point, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670120"
msgid "I holed up in my house and immersed myself\nin the world of the internet.\nI had tons of friends over in Piece Journal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670240"
msgid "\n\n\"You can live off your inheritance, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\"\n\"You can just chill and not have to work?\"\n\"So basically, you're a winner?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670380"
msgid "Sometimes there would be people saying\ndumb stuff out of envy, but it wasn't all\nthat bad of a daily life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670488"
msgid "\"As long as this lifestyle keeps up,\neverything will be good,\" I thought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670564"
msgid "This lifestyle, this lifestyle, this lifestyle―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670620"
msgid "#C255045045Who would've guessed that this lifestyle―\nwould go on for fifteen years.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670712"
msgid "But I was still pretty happy.\nI had no wish for anything special,\nbut to make up for it, I had a realistic, \ndown-to-earth happiness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670848"
msgid "One day, papa and mama just disappeared.\nWhile out shopping, a dump truck that\nshould've stopped at the light rammed through―\nThey just disappeared without a trace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671016"
msgid "My world was plunged into darkness,\nand then my mind was in darkness,\neven after the funeral ended.\nIn such a state, I received my inheritance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671160"
msgid "My internet buddies were nice to me.\nAs long as you don't step on any toes,\nthese friendships last forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671268"
msgid "For a year, five years, even ten years."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671308"
msgid "Until my friends, first one, and then another,\nstarted saying \"I'm moving on.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671388"
msgid "Because they needed money.\nBecause they were getting married.\nBecause their life was a mess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671484"
msgid "\"Nah, c'mon. You know NEETs are the REAL winners.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671536"
msgid "But on returning to the real world,\nall that sat there was an indecipherable human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671628"
msgid "Financially, I had nothing to worry about.\nLiving expenses would be no obstacle until my dying day.\nI could live like this my entire life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671768"
msgid "My entire life. My entire life. My entire life―like this…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671832"
msgid "My head misty, I end up sleeping with sheets\npiled all over me to escape it all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671916"
msgid "I mean, I'm popular on the internet.\nAnd I don't need to go outside.\nAnd I could get my hands on most anything.\nOh, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672044"
msgid "Unaware, and before I had even realized it,\nI had answered with my usual phrase, \"whatever.\"\nAnd then, it was like I had left something important behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672200"
msgid "That's right around when I heard\nrumors of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672280"
msgid "The claims were that the winner\nwould be granted any wish.\nI was confident when it came to games,\nand to be honest, I also believed that\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was a live-or-die thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672480"
msgid "\"This 'the losers will die' stuff is just clickbait.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672536"
msgid "I mean, people die so easily.\nA life isn't anything special."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672600"
msgid "What made the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF special\nwasn't the \"death\" aspect,\nit was the part about \"granting any wish.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672724"
msgid "I joined half out of curiosity\nand just a little bit out of desperation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672800"
msgid "To redo my life.\nUp until I was fifteen years old,\nI thought that way as if it were natural,\nand I expected it to happen in the future\nas if it were natural."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672960"
msgid "To attend high school, normally;\nto go out into society, normally;\nto grow old, normally.\nLooking back at it now, that wish was nonsense, trivial."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673108"
msgid "\n\n…frankly, I was just scared.\n  I would've been happy with any boring, old life, really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673200"
msgid "However,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673212"
msgid "and now that I was reflecting on my life,\nI just wanted to run away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673284"
msgid "I really did think that dying here was possible,\nbut I was cocky and thought I would make it to the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673392"
msgid "No―this is hell, where the talented mass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673436"
msgid "I'm nothing special, I won't be able to\nsurvive even a single battle.\nAnd I was such a winner on the internet…\nI'm just going to lose here, BADLY.\nI probably can't even do 1 damage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673620"
msgid "That's why I have to run away.\nIf I can just hide in some place where there's nobody,\neverything should eventually work itself out again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673760"
msgid "I don't even have a single friend here.\nI've always, always been alone.\nThat's the life I ended up choosing for myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673880"
msgid "#C255045045So I have to run away, or else.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673928"
msgid "All I have left is this persona,\nand if that also falls apart,\nI really will be full of nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674028"
msgid "I'll hurry to a dark room, like I always do.\nOnce I lock the door and cover myself\nwith a futon, I'll be fine.\nI'll quick-swap into the regular #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674196"
msgid "#C255045045So please, don't unlock the door.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674248"
msgid "Don't take my best brave face and crack it wide open.\nDon't look at who I really am and laugh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674344"
msgid "No one will never come―――\nNo one, no one―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674396"
msgid "There's no hope of anyone ever coming into my room―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674456"
msgid "\"Poof\"!?\nW-what magic trickery is this?\nYou just appeared, like, \"poof\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674532"
msgid "Oh, and now you've suddenly appeared, Master.\nIt seems you were whisked away somewhere,\nbut at least you're safe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674648"
msgid "Finally back, huh? You have some gall,\nmaking me wait. You achieved something\ndeserving of that, I presume?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674756"
msgid "…I wonder… if that was a part\nof #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind just now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674832"
msgid "My sights fall again on the model house.\nStored inside the open roof was a small key."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674920"
msgid "There's a model house."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674944"
msgid "What should I do―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674968"
msgid "After coming out of that birth canal-esque corridor,\nwe see #C236196003Jinako#CDEF up ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675064"
msgid "…that's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF… I think.\nProbably, just looking at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675140"
msgid "When it comes to being depressed,\nshe just keeps getting upgrades.\nShe's an artisan at it at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675248"
msgid "If she were in an extreme contest of who could\nuse a futon best out of dejection,\nshe could definitely aim for the top."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675368"
msgid "…you came this far in, again? I could throw\nevery resource I have at you and it wouldn't be\nenough. What are you, my guardian? A stalker?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "675508"
msgid "Sort of like a girlfriend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675536"
msgid "A blind alley; a very dead and very ending\nterminator―the very worst."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675608"
msgid "You're going to flatter me and say, like…\nsomeone is definitely looking out for me? A nice\nperson? How do you \"look out for someone\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675744"
msgid "Only people with that privilege \nget that pleasure. The only person\nI'm able to look out for is myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675848"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's got no family any more,\nand I don't feel like making a new one.\nThat kinda thing is super occult, imo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675976"
msgid "Ever heard this?\nThey say \"friends\" are actually people who\nare more miserable than yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676072"
msgid "Is that what you want to become, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nThen I want you to stay in the Labyrinth with me\nforever and ever. Then we'll be equals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676220"
msgid "But there's no way you'd ever agree.\nYou're lookin' to get out or whatever. As if.\nI got my hopes up about that for a bit, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676348"
msgid "Ah, but if we're talking about who's\nin a miserable position,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF would be the premiere friend material."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676472"
msgid "But I will never be friends with that\nsuper-#RUBS  sparkling#RUBEbrilliant#REND-rank Servant, #C236196003Karna#CDEF.\nThis whole thing was weird from the start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676632"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF gets wound up,\nstomping a foot against the floor.\nShe's been backed into a corner, physically and mentally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676764"
msgid "She's distancing herself from just about everything,\neven wanting to drive #C236196003Karna#CDEF so far away she can\nhardly see him―to be alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676912"
msgid "Because that's the easiest way\nshe can go on living without worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676980"
msgid "Stop…… How many times are you gonna\nmake me say it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677036"
msgid "I just haven't… been #RUBS  serious#RUBEoutgoing#REND, yet.\nI'll do better… in the next life… I will…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677144"
msgid "I recognize this throbbing in my left arm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677188"
msgid "However――is making #C236196003Jinako#CDEF aware of her\n#C000246204SG#CDEF's true nature really the best thing to do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677308"
msgid "And will that then be what saves #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677368"
msgid "…she's incorrigible.\nNow my headaches are acting up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677424"
msgid "At this point, how about just asking #C236196003Karna#CDEF\nto look after her? Shall I turn back and\nguide him here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677540"
msgid "No, I… Hmph.\nMy goodness, do you like caring for others.\nI knew you would give me that look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677636"
msgid "It's said that loneliness is a fatal\ndisease, but… her reluctance is more\ningrained in her than that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677740"
msgid "Rather than directly experience loneliness,\ndeath can seem a better option."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677816"
msgid "Pretending to be aloof can be intoxicating. The\nstronger self-sacrifice and narrower outlook\ndeepens madness. Then poof, back to normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677956"
msgid "The anesthetic wears off, and from the wound\nreturns the accumulated agony…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678036"
msgid "I… REALLY don't understand one BIT.\nDarling is so graciously present here and YET\nshe throws a tantrum?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678144"
msgid "There's no need.\nLook to the sensation you had.\nThat's the key to unraveling this woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678236"
msgid "Simply, she wishes for a similar people.\n\"I want you to stay where you are.\"\nIt's a most straightforward desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678352"
msgid "…right now within me, my heart is neither\ntrying to understand #C236196003Jinako#CDEF nor trying to save her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678464"
msgid "It's just―I can't leave her like this. That's all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678516"
msgid "I won't say something like \"I can't abandon you\"\nor \"don't give up.\" If I'm not her friend, fine.\nAs her neighbor, I have this to tell her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "678664"
msgid "You're not alone, Jinako."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678692"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, I'm not alone.\nEveryone is getting along swell."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "678752"
msgid "You're not alone, Jinako."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678780"
msgid "I confirmed that you extracted her #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nIt's named… \"#C000246204Loneliness#CDEF,\" I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678892"
msgid "The Shield partitioning the floor breaks,\nand the corporeal concentration of the\ntemporary #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's body dilutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679024"
msgid "Ah, man…\nI guess #C236196003BB#CDEF is gonna be mad at my True Self.\nThat's weird to think about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679124"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF faintly murmurs, as if speaking about somebody else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679200"
msgid "Hearing #C236196003BB#CDEF's name startles me to attention,\nbut right now there's nothing indicating\nthat she's going to appear.\nNot that I could do anything about it,\nwhether I knew beforehand or not…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679404"
msgid "Even if we escape, even if there are friends,\nthe end result is the same. Next time,\nI'll make sure you know what I mean. Payback."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "679536"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "679568"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "679596"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "679624"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "679652"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679680"
msgid "The door is shut tight.\nLooks like we need a key to open it.\nWe could go through with breaking it down,\nbut then we'd have to be ready to fight #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679848"
msgid "Let's search for the key instead.\nI wonder… Where could that key be?\nLet's look around a bit more."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "679948"
msgid "We don't have any other options.\nPlease search for Miss Carigiri."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680016"
msgid "It'll be fine, you're the most suitable Master\nfor boring work such as this."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680096"
msgid "Did you hear that? Listen carefully, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680144"
msgid "Leave me alone… Jinako has class changed\nto the rug on the floor class."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680220"
msgid "Nothing matters anymore…\nI don't want to think anymore…"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680280"
msgid "How timid does she have to be to drag us around\nlike this!? She's getting a lecture after this!!!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680380"
msgid "Third time's the charm. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680416"
msgid "This negative aura, there's no mistaking it…\nGive me a rope this time!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680488"
msgid "This farce has overstayed its welcome.\nDo you understand?"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680548"
msgid "She really called in her friends, huh.\nSeveral enemy readings detected."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "680620"
msgid "This must be the true form of this floor.\nPlease try returning to Launcher for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680704"
msgid "This is the bed #C236196003Jinako#CDEF was using."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680756"
msgid "With no one on it, and compared to its surroundings,\nit gives an impression of desolation.\nIt's as if it were a representation of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680920"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681036"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681188"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681316"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681452"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681596"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681752"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681864"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681980"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682116"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682232"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682332"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682452"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682580"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682716"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682860"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682996"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683136"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683252"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683388"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683504"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683588"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683712"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683824"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683952"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684088"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684200"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684332"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684452"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684588"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684700"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684828"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684960"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685100"
msgid "……………I couldn't believe my own eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685144"
msgid "The Labyrinth floor stretches out to the…\nerr, vanishing point―anyway, it stretches REALLY far…\nIn this vast, BARREN space,\nthere are no surfaces where the walls would be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685320"
msgid "THIS is the eleventh floor of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF#[?][…?]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685400"
msgid "Hmph. Why are you spacing out, Praetor?\nSure, I was also taken back a tad,\nbut isn't this a nice bit of variety!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685516"
msgid "Proceed #[gallantly][glamorously]#.\nAll tracks you leave form roads, Praetor.\nAnd all roads lead to the Core, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685632"
msgid "Let's not dwell on whether that's\nfor better or worse though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685696"
msgid "No sign of any obstacles at all, though that's\nalso pretty discomforting. I'm worried I\nmight not be able to stay focused…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685820"
msgid "Instead of getting of getting swept through\ndetours in a complex Labyrinth, it seems like\nwe'll be stuck running in circles here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685952"
msgid "Hmm? Ahh… I see now. It more or less looks\nlike this Labyrinth is finite.\nThat CONFIRMS that this map is half-ass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686068"
msgid "It's astonishingly vacant.\nThe mind, by its nature, IS a deep and dense\nthing. But this is merely a cave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686176"
msgid "To suffer yet have no worries.\nTo be lost yet have no objective.\nThat's what this landscape embodies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686280"
msgid "Let's go, mongrel.\nGet us quickly to the end of this, if you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686348"
msgid "I'm a little unsure of what to do, but with what #C236196003#SVT#CDEF said,\nall we can do is take a look around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686464"
msgid "Uhhh, to start off… We'll just have to go straight, #[I guess][maybe]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686540"
msgid "Within the endless stretches of this wasteland,\nwe happen upon a still, lone figure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686628"
msgid "But… wh-what gives? I get the feeling that,\nliterally, all he's doing is standing here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686720"
msgid "I don't know if my exhaustion passed on to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF or what,\nbut there's not a moment to rest before it's time to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686856"
msgid "Also, #C236196003Karna#CDEF's expression isn't telling me\nanything about what he's thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686952"
msgid "He's like a husky, tied to the storefront\nand waiting for his owner to return…\nThough it's a little rude to compare him to a dog,\nthat's the impression I get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687112"
msgid "…maybe he's not thinking about anything?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687156"
msgid "I'm not sure if he's devoid of any ambition\nor just #RUBS           flat   #RUBEdetached from desire#REND… Regardless,\nhe's not acting like a Heroic Spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687316"
msgid "I just don't get it.\nDeep down in his soul, does this guy\neven #RUBS         have a wish #RUBE#C000246204desire the Holy Grail#CDEF#REND…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687456"
msgid "I just can't sense any intent to fight from\nof this guy… but we're after #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nWhere did she go?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687572"
msgid "…I don't want to believe it, but is he doing\nthis to act like a decoy?\nNo, there's no way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687664"
msgid "He's acting alone; let's JUMP him! …though,\nknowing this guy… How about we play dumb and\ncutesy to win him ov―err, persuade him?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687796"
msgid "…this man is a real damper on my bloodlust.\nI don't feel like slaying him when he has THAT\nenfeebled and stupid of an expression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687928"
msgid "Mongrel, call out to him.\nThis is a situation to be exchanging\nnot blows, but words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688016"
msgid "…well, it IS pointless to keep\nglaring at each other.\nThankfully, it's easy to get through\nto this guy with just words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688140"
msgid "Let's try getting straight to the point―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "688188"
msgid "Working hard, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688212"
msgid "So, did your owner get sick of you? Noble hero\nof the East, I suppose your exalted self was\ntoo dazzling for that lazy girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688340"
msgid "What happened to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF?\nDid she pull herself out of the fighting?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688448"
msgid "Intending on evaporating into the wind or\nsomething? You stand before the king. Don't\nfeign innocence. Where is your Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688576"
msgid "So you're searching for #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\n…I know where you're coming from, but forgive\nme. I haven't acquired her location."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688708"
msgid "Of course, as a Servant, I pursued my\nMaster's location. But she repeatedly\nrebuked me, telling me to stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688816"
msgid "Thus, here I am, pretending to be a gatekeeper.\nPretending, and nothing more.\nAn out-of-work Labyrinth guard… essentially."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688940"
msgid "Knowing #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, she's probably somewhere on this\nfloor showing the world her disgraceful side.\nHow about checking around at random?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689088"
msgid "―――Sorry, I'm afraid I have\nno refreshments to offer;\nI can't offer you a very warm welcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689184"
msgid "Ahh, in #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's room at the school, she has\nfried potato treats, twig-like baked wheat\ntreats, bean-filled mushroom-shoots, etc――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689336"
msgid "These fattening items of the masses came easily\nand plentifully to her, but #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is no longer\nin a state of mind to scarf them down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689488"
msgid "…she may have lost a little weight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689528"
msgid "Umm, but,\nis it okay to just leave her by herself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689580"
msgid "She's disposed to losing her composure in open\nareas, you see. Perhaps she's curled up in\nsome corner of the Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689700"
msgid "As expected, #C236196003La……uncher#CDEF shows no signs of attacking.\nWe step away, leaving him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689800"
msgid "Go ahead.\nProactively impeding your exploration…\nis not something I was ordered to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689888"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF is standing in the same spot.\nBut some detail of the Labyrinth has changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689988"
msgid "A door that wasn't there before\nhas appeared beside #C236196003Karna#CDEF.\nAlso, its design is familiar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690096"
msgid "No hints of any changes in #C236196003Karna#CDEF, as expected.\nHe's exactly as tranquil now as when we first\nencountered him on this layer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690236"
msgid "Praetor. That man is showing no hostility.\nShould we ask him about the location of\nwhat we're looking for?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690344"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF spoke about himself as gatekeeper…\nI didn't think he actually meant it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690440"
msgid "A pecuuuliar tension always comes from this man,\nlike from a Buddha statue or a totem pole… He's\nof the sun, but maybe in a solar eclipse way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690584"
msgid "So we did come here. Look at you, mongrel.\nI didn't even have to tell you to\nvisit this spot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690680"
msgid "Anyway, we can't just not investigate\nthis door here.\nBut the problem is #C236196003Karna#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "690780"
msgid "What if I said I'm going through there?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "690820"
msgid "Is there no choice but for us to fight?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "690860"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is behind this door?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690904"
msgid "If you wish to go through that door, then go.\nYou have work to do, no?\nI have no intention of stopping you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691012"
msgid "…are you testing me?\nI can't answer a question like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691072"
msgid "―――Well, I shouldn't be saying that.\nIt may be possible now that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nis not the person I thought she was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691200"
msgid "I don't intend to stop you if you wish\nto meet her face to face.\nGo see for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691288"
msgid "However, there's something I must ask.\nDo you happen to have the key to this house?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691372"
msgid "So you found it already.\nThen you should be able to enter without issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691448"
msgid "My words don't reach this #C236196003Jinako#CDEF… Well, they\nnever reached her much from the outset, I feel,\nbut please don't point that out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691592"
msgid "Battle―life cannot first form\nwithout confrontation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691648"
msgid "However… it seems that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's enemy\nright now is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF herself.\nNothing is likely to come of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691784"
msgid "Wrinkles of lament for his helplessness\ncarve into #C236196003Karna#CDEF's brow as he speaks his mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691888"
msgid "Without that key, the door won't open.\nIf you try to break it down,\nI'll hold you back with all of my might."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692000"
msgid "Be good and search for the key.\nThat's the fastest way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692056"
msgid "Use that key and the door will open. This will\nbe a rough way to settle things, but sometimes\ndrastic measures are needed, I suppose…"
msgstr ""

